{
 "language": "en",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.44,
   "end": 7.12,
   "text": "Hey everybody you want the secret to Persian delights let's make some cooby"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.12,
   "end": 13.3,
   "text": "tonight. Get your skewers ready. Fire up the grill."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.68,
   "end": 29.36,
   "text": "Two pounds of lamb, a beef with some fat, three grated onions."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.54,
   "end": 31.46,
   "text": "Now how about that? Squeeze out the juice."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.68,
   "end": 34.86,
   "text": "Don't let it stay. We want that meat to hold its shape."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.86,
   "end": 37.08,
   "text": "Add salt and pepper, season it right"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.08,
   "end": 39.28,
   "text": "A little turmeric if you like the bite"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.28,
   "end": 41.62,
   "text": "Keep it simple, keep it real"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.62,
   "end": 43.92,
   "text": "That's how you start a Persian meal"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.46,
   "end": 46.54,
   "text": "Mix it, mash it, work that meat"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.54,
   "end": 48.8,
   "text": "Knead it till the texture's smooth and neat"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.8,
   "end": 50.86,
   "text": "Ten minutes strong, let the flavors unite"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.86,
   "end": 53.22,
   "text": "Cover and chill it, let it rest overnight"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.7,
   "end": 59.3,
   "text": "Kubi de, Kubi de, Persian kebab is on the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.3,
   "end": 61.62,
   "text": "On the skewer, on the flame"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.62,
   "end": 63.74,
   "text": "Smoky, juicy, that's the game"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.38,
   "end": 68.14,
   "text": "Could be that, could be that, turn it fast, don't let it fall away"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.14,
   "end": 74.14,
   "text": "Rice and butter, sumac too, virgin barbecue is waiting for you"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.8,
   "end": 81.04,
   "text": "Watch your hands now grab a ball, press it gently, spread it tall"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.04,
   "end": 85.58,
   "text": "Place the meat on a flat metal skewer, shape it evenly, make it smoother"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.58,
   "end": 89.78,
   "text": "Pinch the ridges with your thumb, make those classic brews become"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.78,
   "end": 92.22,
   "text": "Seal the edges, hold it tight"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.22,
   "end": 94.28,
   "text": "Keep that meat up on the skewer right"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.28,
   "end": 97.12,
   "text": "Gotta get your charcoal going red"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.12,
   "end": 99.32,
   "text": "No big flames beneath the bread"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.32,
   "end": 101.7,
   "text": "Place the skewers side by side"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.7,
   "end": 103.82,
   "text": "Turn them quickly, don't let them slide"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.82,
   "end": 106.0,
   "text": "Flip them off and at the start"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.0,
   "end": 108.26,
   "text": "That's the secret, that's the art"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.26,
   "end": 110.44,
   "text": "Cook till golden juicy inside"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.44,
   "end": 112.98,
   "text": "No raw meat left when it's time to die"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.42,
   "end": 117.74,
   "text": "Grilled tomatoes, charred and sweet"
  },
  {
   "start": 117.74,
   "end": 119.92,
   "text": "Fresh herbs make the perfect treat"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.92,
   "end": 121.74,
   "text": "Saffron, rice and golden light"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.26,
   "end": 124.38,
   "text": "Butter melting, what a sight"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.38,
   "end": 126.66,
   "text": "Sprinkle sumac, squeeze some lime"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.66,
   "end": 128.68,
   "text": "Gather round it's dinner time"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.68,
   "end": 131.0,
   "text": "From Tehran streets to Lanza Far"
  },
  {
   "start": 131.0,
   "end": 133.36,
   "text": "Persian kubi de the barbecue star"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.5,
   "end": 137.08,
   "text": "Kubi de, kubi de"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.08,
   "end": 139.3,
   "text": "Made with love the Persian way"
  },
  {
   "start": 139.3,
   "end": 141.56,
   "text": "Onions, meat and charcoal heat"
  },
  {
   "start": 141.56,
   "end": 143.68,
   "text": "Nothing beats this smoky treat"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.68,
   "end": 145.92,
   "text": "Oh, kubi de, kubi de"
  },
  {
   "start": 145.92,
   "end": 148.34,
   "text": "Bring the family, shout hooray!"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.56,
   "end": 151.66,
   "text": "Saffron, rice and kebabs, divine Persian flavor"
  },
  {
   "start": 152.92,
   "end": 153.78,
   "text": "Every time"
  },
  {
   "start": 154.96,
   "end": 157.48,
   "text": "Remember the rule, now here's the key"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.48,
   "end": 160.76,
   "text": "Squeeze those onions, knead carefully"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.92,
   "end": 164.22,
   "text": "Keep turning till the meat is done"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.28,
   "end": 166.72,
   "text": "Persian Kubida"
  },
  {
   "start": 167.56,
   "end": 169.3,
   "text": "Now that's fun"
  }
 ],
